127.0.0.1 assets.claude.ai
127.0.0.1 accounts.claude.ai
127.0.0.1 auth.claude.ai
127.0.0.1 billing.claude.ai

# --- Claude 用户生成内容与渲染沙盒 (Artifacts / User Content) ---
